Cannot tell. It seems to have similarities in appearance, at least.

Grappling hook in german is "Enterhaken",
http://www.designschmied.de/Schmiede/Bildergro%DF/Enterhaken.jpg,
There's another type called "Wurfanker" (an "anchor to throw"),
the one that has similarities to the "grappling hook" as depicted
if searching images at Google.

German Wikipedia clarifies that:
"Ein Enterhaken ist entweder eine stabile Stange mit einem oder
  mehreren Haken an einem Ende oder ein Seil mit einem Dreizack-
  Widerhaken am Ende."

It's either a solid staff with one or more hooks at one end, or
it's a rope with a "trident barbed hook"(sem.?) at the end.

I assume, as the grappling hook in Nethack works, it's the staff
version. And it seems to be something similar (equal?) to a gaff.

